  expected by a/a.canon:21 (retired gold { /// K. k: K /// Payload. p: P(k) })
  in build (a/a.canon:70)

error[E3506]  a/a.canon:65:11
  second.cur.r: Reward.gold is retired (only a retired entry or a past Reward may hold it)
  expected by a/a.canon:21 (retired gold { /// K. k: K /// Payload. p: P(k) })
  in build2 (a/a.canon:73)

